items.description:
We’re Furniture1, an online furniture retailer transforming the way people buy furniture. Operating in more than 20 countries, we combine simplicity, design, and convenience to create a better online furniture shopping experience for our customers. As a fast-growing company, we’re always on the lookout for new talent, whether you're a seasoned professional or exploring a new career path.

At the moment, we’re looking for a Senior SEO Specialist to help us shape the future of online furniture retail.

In this position, you’ll

Lead the SEO strategy by planning advanced tests and analyzing results to drive high-impact organic campaigns;
Master website analytics to identify deep trends and lead the integration of insights with the PPC team;
Optimize high-performance landing pages and ad copy to maximize click rates and search visibility;
Architect advanced keyword strategies to ensure we reach and convert the right high-value audience;
Stay ahead of search algorithms and best practices to maintain a competitive edge in website performance;
Conduct deep competitor analysis to build strategies that secure our market leadership;
Drive high-authority link-building initiatives to significantly strengthen our online presence;
Partner with cross-functional teams to ensure SEO is a core part of all digital initiatives.

We expect that you have

Extensive experience in SEO with a proven track record of delivering measurable growth;
Expert knowledge of search engine algorithms and ranking factors;
Advanced proficiency in Google Analytics and professional SEO toolsets;
Excellent communication and writing skills in both Lithuanian and English;
Technical literacy in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript as they relate to SEO.

What we offer

Compensation

Gross salary from 3000 - 4300 EUR/month based on your experience and skills
Flexible salary and performance reviews. We don’t wait for fixed salary review deadlines - we recognize your growth and impact in real time
Performance-based bonus system. We reward great work with bonuses to keep motivation high and efforts appreciated. Your success is the company’s success

Health and wellbeing

Private health insurance after working with us for 3 months
Individual psychologist or psychotherapist sessions

Learning and development

Continuous learning and professional growth. Learn from experienced team members and take on different projects and initiatives
Access to online learning platforms. We encourage our team members to improve their skills through online courses, fully covered by us

Time-off and bonus perks

Paid birthday day off, team building events, workations and other additional perks.

If you’re interested in this position, we’d be happy to hear from you at hr@furniture1.eu
